  "  enonce: \"## 1.4 Les cercles et les points\\n\\nLa fonction \\\\`circle(R)\\\\` dessine un cercle de **rayon** \\\\`R\\\\`.\\n\\nLa fonction \\\\`dot(D)\\\\` dessine un disque rempli de **diamètre** \\\\`D\\\\`, centré sur la position actuelle de la tortue.\\n\\n\\\\`\\\\`\\\\`python\\nfrom turtle import *\\n\\ncircle(100)\\ndot(50)\\n\\ndone()\\n\\n\\\\`\\\\`\\\\`\\n\\n**&nbsp; **Exercice 4a — Bonhomme de neige****\\n\\nDessinez une tête de bonhomme de neige en utilisant :\\n\\n- \\\\`circle(R)\\\\` pour le corps et la tête ;\\n- \\\\`dot(D)\\\\` pour les yeux et les boutons ;\\n- \\\\`goto(x, y)\\\\` et \\\\`penup()\\\\` pour vous déplacer.\\n\\nPour le nez, vous pouvez utiliser :\\n\\n\\\\`\\\\`\\\\`python\\ndot(12, \\\"orange\\\")\\n\\\\`\\\\`\\\\`\\n\\n\\n<style>\\n.zone {\\n  position: relative;\\n  width: 500px;\\n  height: 450px;\\n  background: white;\\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\n  color: #444;\\n}\\n\\n/* Axes */\\n.axe-horizontal {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 0;\\n  top: 420px;\\n  width: 500px;\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: #444;\\n}\\n\\n.axe-vertical {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 245px;\\n  top: 0;\\n  width: 1px;\\n  height: 430px;\\n  background: #444;\\n}\\n\\n/* Grand cercle */\\n.cercle {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 45px;\\n  top: 20px;\\n  width: 400px;\\n  height: 400px;\\n  border: 3px solid #555;\\n  border-radius: 50%;\\n  box-sizing: border-box;\\n}\\n\\n/* Graduations horizontales */\\n.graduation-x {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  top: 416px;\\n  width: 1px;\\n  height: 9px;\\n  background: #444;\\n}\\n\\n/* Graduations verticales */\\n.graduation-y {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 241px;\\n  width: 9px;\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: #444;\\n}\\n\\n/* Nombres sur l'axe horizontal */\\n.nombre-x {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  top: 425px;\\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\\n  font-size: 12px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Nombres sur l'axe vertical */\\n.nombre-y {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 220px;\\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\\n  font-size: 12px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Points */\\n.point {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  width: 45px;\\n  height: 45px;\\n  border-radius: 50%;\\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 4px #777;\\n}\\n\\n.point-gauche {\\n  left: 166px;\\n  top: 180px;\\n  background: black;\\n}\\n\\n.point-droit {\\n  left: 326px;\\n  top: 180px;\\n  background: #222;\\n}\\n\\n.point-orange {\\n  left: 246px;\\n  top: 260px;\\n  background: #e87500;\\n}\\n\\n/* Origine */\\n.origine {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 241px;\\n  top: 416px;\\n  width: 9px;\\n  height: 9px;\\n  border-radius: 50%;\\n  background: #555;\\n}\\n\\n.lettre-b {\\n  position: absolute;\\n  left: 250px;\\n  top: 427px;\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n</style>\\n\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"zone\\\">\\n\\n<!-- Axes -->\\n<div class=\\\"axe-horizontal\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"axe-vertical\\\"></div>\\n\\n<!-- Cercle -->\\n<div class=\\\"cercle\\\"></div>\\n\\n<!-- Graduations sur l'axe X -->\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 5px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 85px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 165px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 245px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 325px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 405px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 485px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n<!-- Nombres sur l'axe X -->\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 5px;\\\">-60</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 85px;\\\">-40</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 165px;\\\">-20</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 245px;\\\">0</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 325px;\\\">20</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 405px;\\\">40</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-x\\\" style=\\\"left: 485px;\\\">60</span>\\n\\n<!-- Graduations sur l'axe Y -->\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 340px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 260px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 180px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 100px;\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"graduation-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 20px;\\\"></div>\\n\\n<!-- Nombres sur l'axe Y -->\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 340px;\\\">20</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 260px;\\\">40</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 180px;\\\">60</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 100px;\\\">80</span>\\n<span class=\\\"nombre-y\\\" style=\\\"top: 20px;\\\">100</span>\\n\\n<!-- Points -->\\n<div class=\\\"point point-gauche\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"point point-droit\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"point point-orange\\\"></div>\\n\\n<!-- Origine -->\\n<div class=\\\"origine\\\"></div>\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n</body>\"",
