  "    <div><img alt=\"monstre binaire\" src=\"https://github.com/College-Sismondi-Informatique/exercices-1in/blob/main/Notebooks/imgs_chap1/monstre_binaire.png?raw=true\" style=\"width:180px;max-width:100%\"/></div>",
